
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Our Books | InkAura Books</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Explore digital Bible storybooks, colouring books, educational books and creative publications at InkAura Books.">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #fff;
      color: #292929;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      padding: 18px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee4cc;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .logo {
      color: #b18a35;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #333;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #b18a35;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 55px 20px 35px;
      background: #fffdf8;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      color: #a9822f;
      font-size: 34px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #666;
    }

    .container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 40px auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      color: #a9822f;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .categories {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 55px;
    }

    .category {
      display: block;
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid #eadfca;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #333;
      background: #fff;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .category:hover {
      border-color: #c5a04d;
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .category h3 {
      color: #a9822f;
      margin-bottom: 7px;
    }

    .book-card {
      max-width: 750px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 260px) 1fr;
      gap: 25px;
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid #eadfca;
      border-radius: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .book-card img {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 260px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      display: block;
    }

    .book-info h3 {
      color: #a9822f;
      font-size: 23px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .book-info p {
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .price {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #333;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 11px 20px;
      background: #b18a35;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: #94702a;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #fffaf0;
      border-left: 3px solid #b18a35;
      color: #66552f;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 60px;
      padding: 25px 15px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #fffdf8;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee4cc;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      nav {
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      .book-card {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .book-card img {
        max-width: 230px;
        margin: auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <a class="logo" href="index.html">InkAura Books</a>

    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="books.html">Books</a>
      <a href="signin.html">Sign In</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Explore Our Books</h1>
    <p>
      Discover meaningful stories, Bible-inspired publications,
      colouring activities and educational resources.
    </p>
  </section>

  <main class="container">

    <h2 class="section-title">Browse Collections</h2>

    <div class="categories">

      <a class="category" href="category.html?type=bible">
        <h3>Bible Storybooks</h3>
        <p>Stories and learning inspired by Scripture.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="category" href="category.html?type=colouring">
        <h3>Colouring & Activities</h3>
        <p>Creative activities for learning and enjoyment.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="category" href="category.html?type=education">
        <h3>Educational Books</h3>
        <p>Resources designed to support learning.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="category" href="category.html?type=creative">
        <h3>Creative Stories</h3>
        <p>Imaginative publications and original stories.</p>
      </a>

    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">Featured Publication</h2>

    <div class="book-card">

      <img
        src="preview-cover.jpg"
        alt="God's Wonderful Creation book cover"
      >

      <div class="book-info">
        <h3>God's Wonderful Creation</h3>

        <p>
          A Bible Colouring Storybook based on Genesis chapters 1–3.
          Explore the beginning of creation through Scripture,
          storytelling and colouring activities.
        </p>

        <p class="price">GH₵25.00</p>

        <a
          class="button"
          href="book-gods-wonderful-creation.html"
        >
          View Book
        </a>

        <div class="notice">
          This is a digital publication. Online purchasing and
          secure delivery are not yet activated.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>InkAura Books — Where Possibilities Grow.</p>
    <p>© 2026 InkAura Books. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
